{"id": "t114-006", "text": "so Paolo and his wife are doing three weeks in Japan in April, Tokyo then Kyoto then Osaka, he's been learning Japanese on Duolingo for like a year for it. Their kids are staying with her parents. He did say the flight's the bit he's worried about, he hates flying, last long haul he didn't sleep at all", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Paolo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "three weeks in Japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning Japanese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "like a year"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates flying", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t114-008", "text": "Angela - knits. Like seriously, she's doing a jumper for every grandchild before Christmas. Seven of them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knits", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandchild", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Christmas"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Seven of them", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t114-011", "text": "Henrik is a big Formula 1 guy, Ferrari fan since the Schumacher days, goes to Silverstone every July with his brother Lukas and camps for the whole weekend. Also does sim racing at home, has a proper rig with pedals in the spare room. Mentioned he'd love the new Lewis Hamilton book, good shout for his birthday 3rd of December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Formula 1", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ferrari", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the Schumacher days"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Silverstone", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every July"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the whole weekend"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sim racing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "proper rig with pedals", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "love the new Lewis Hamilton book", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of December", "anchor": "e1"}]}
