{"id": "t114-042", "text": "Cem had his physio appointment yesterday, it's a tear in the meniscus apparently. Might need surgery, which would rule out Berlin. He's properly down about it, he's been training since March and already paid for the hotel. His girlfriend Kerry is trying to keep him positive. Remind me to ring him after his scan next Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Cem", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "tear in the meniscus", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Berlin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "down", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since March"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t114-045", "text": "Anan supports Liverpool, collects old matchday programmes, has hundreds. Mentioned a 1977 European Cup final one would be his holy grail. Christmas present idea if I ever see one.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Liverpool", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old matchday programmes", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has hundreds", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "1977 European Cup final one would be his holy grail", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas"}]}
{"id": "t114-046", "text": "Jorge's daughter's graduation is 10th July in Glasgow, the whole family's going up. He's driving up the day before with the dog, his wife's flying with her mum because she can't do eight hours in a car with her hip. Daughter's got a first in marine biology and already has a job lined up in Aberdeen starting September. He's very proud.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduation", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "10th July", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't do eight hours in a car with her hip", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "first in marine biology", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job lined up in Aberdeen", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t114-051", "text": "Rin's back from Japan. Said her grandma's not well, early dementia, didn't recognise her at first. She was really upset about it. I need to take her out for coffee this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandma", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "early dementia", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "upset", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her out for coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
