{"id": "t114-057", "text": "Kerry's son is in the school production of Oliver! next Tuesday and Wednesday, he's the Artful Dodger. She's been sewing his costume all week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school production of Oliver", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday and Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Artful Dodger", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week"}]}
{"id": "t114-058", "text": "Laura and her partner off to Mexico tomorrow for two weeks, then a week in Cuba. She's been planning it since last year. Ask her how Havana was when she's back on the 3rd.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Mexico", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week in Cuba", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since last year"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her how Havana was", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she's back on the 3rd", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t114-059", "text": "Ibrahim's daughter Hadiza has her violin recital on 22 November, Grade 8. He said she's been practising four hours a day and is a nervous wreck. Wish her luck the night before. He also said he's training for a triathlon in the spring, open water swimming every Saturday morning at the lake.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hadiza", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "violin recital", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Grade 8", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "four hours a day"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous wreck", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Wish her luck", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "triathlon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "open water swimming", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Saturday morning"}]}
